  "name": "GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst",
  "family": "OpenAI",
  "description": "OpenAI's high-fidelity image model (September 2026) for detail-rich edits; slower than Flare. Also on WaveSpeedAI. Also on Comfy Cloud. Also on ToAPIs. Adapter written from the provider's docs, not run against the live API yet.",
